==Battleground==
*30 [[Pigeon de Sable]]s spawn after 3.33 seconds<sup>100f</sup>, delay 40~46.67 seconds<sup>1,200f~1,400f</sup>.
*1 [[Devil Wife]] spawns after 10 seconds<sup>300f</sup>.
*1 [[Pigeon de Sable]] spawns after 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Le'Prude]] spawns as the boss.
**2 [[Mini White Cyclone]]s spawn after 6.67 seconds<sup>200f</sup>, delay 93.33 seconds<sup>2,800f</sup>.
**4 [[Devil Wife|Devil Wives]] spawn after 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>, delay 53.33~60 seconds<sup>1,600f~1,800f</sup>.
**1 [[Doctor K.O.]] spawns after 23.33 seconds<sup>700f</sup>.
**1 [[Le'Behemoth]] spawns after 46.67 seconds<sup>1,400f</sup>.

==Strategy==
A straightforward stage: stall at the beginning for cash, then cripple Le'Prude before Le'Behemoth arrives to the scene. The main thing getting in your way is Mini White Cyclone, so you'll need to get creative with separating him from the Red menace so that your [[Swimmer Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Fishmen]] and [[Hip Hop Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Can Cans]] can actually land hits. [[Master of Logic Newtone (Special Cat)|Master of Logic Mewtone]] and the [[Ototo Corps#Slow Beam|Slow Beam]] are your best means to that end, since Le'Prude stays stunlocked moonwalking while your units gang up on Mini White Cyclone. Feel free to use [[Talents|Talented]] [[Bahamut Cat (Special Cat)|Awakened Bahamut Cat]] to nuke him faster while they're both Slowed.

Once Mini White Cyclone is out of the picture, [[Sushi Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Roe Cat]] easily holds the line with some help from [[Carpenter Cat (Rare Cat)|Rapper Cat]], and crowd-controls Le'Prude whilst Talented [[Dom Cat (Special Cat)|Dark Lazer]] and [[Cutter Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Neo Cutter Cat]] turn him into a stylized hide jacket. You ideally want Le'Prude dead before the second Mini White Cyclone spawns. If you achieve this, it's easy enough to handle remaining supports individually.

